' Notes
note right of Admin
  <b>Admin Role:</b>
  - Full system oversight
  - User & department management
  - View all issues (read-only)
  - Comment on issues
  - Cannot assign or change status
  - Access to all reports & audit logs
end note

note right of HOD
  <b>HOD Role:</b>
  - Manage department issues
  - Assign issues to staff
  - Change priority & status
  - Close and reopen issues
  - View department reports
  - Data validation
end note

note right of Staff
  <b>Staff Role:</b>
  - Report issues
  - Update assigned issue status
  - (OPEN → IN_PROGRESS → RESOLVED)
  - Add comments
  - Upload/download attachments
  - Data validation
end note

